  1. Yeni Admin Modules: Analytics, Activity Log, Notifications, Pages CMS, Settings, Case Studies, FAQ, Partners, Team Members, Pricing Plans, Testimonials
  2. React Miqrasiya: Home səhifəsi (~88% vizual paritet)
  3. Yeni Dizayn: _new.blade.php - 8+ səhifə
  4. Translations: AZ/EN/RU (front + admin)
  5. Package-lər: Inertia, Sentry, Spatie Activity Log, SweetAlert, DataTables

